{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/c2x0ehl2ermd14puhpgq7usq335dgjd.mp3","text":"呣？想要祈祷吗？抱歉，暂时没空哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/849zo096pmwol08ne2vpey7k68px1i4.mp3","text":"呣？我是现任圣女没错哦。但无论是谁——都有被繁重事务压得喘不过气，想要轻松一下的时候吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/87ncftnbdyj4chxaap8civ1pqkmhm70.mp3","text":"在闲杂事务上浪费时间才叫懈怠，我只是......比较擅长寻找机会养精蓄锐而已。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/51/2gqsglkinfe2dwfnulfzsiku4t3ouga.mp3","text":"出来玩耍就要尽兴，别把那些条条框框套在我身上呀。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/bjthzkssytqykx87jxii9iccqx8960u.mp3","text":"喀兰的神祇吗？因为圣女职务的关系，我和她关系不浅呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/p4f602b5r6u18ezv0dt0h85jp6gchvf.mp3","text":"我也很愿意帮助你，但圣女的工作实在是太繁忙了。这次就破例一回，可不要占用我太多时间哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/fntzk2iyab0x61mgt37iydlf3z9se4h.mp3","text":"妹——恩希亚那孩子，罗德岛的各位也都挺喜欢她的，是吧？所以，并不是那个人特殊对待她。现在的话，我也算稍微明白了些。嗯，这样就好了，我只要像现在这样看着她就好了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/qi7n576t7o5g54kg8fov6eq1584agxw.mp3","text":"小时候，我在外玩耍扭伤了脚，是哥哥背了我一晚上才找到了住家。那时我想着，一定要成为哥哥那样的人。但是现在......呵，没什么。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/lxdaav05mv4o71wn5b3dveo1gymskbv.mp3","text":"咦，你怎么找到我的？啧，我要把你的脚趾冻上......唔？咖啡？给我的？谢谢。博士要不要也在这偷会儿懒？这里的风景很好。把这里当作我们两个人的秘密吧。唔，好苦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/5ec9ysw5pjvmxx6edoxz50mtso06t3g.mp3","text":"难得的小憩呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:6/61/dl7qghqatmfoccr4o34pfscymzlz2y6.mp3","text":"嘘，我是偷偷跑出来——啊，嗯，人事主管你也在啊，是的，我是来协助罗德岛的。喀兰圣女，初雪，向你献上至洁的祝福。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/gemba939exa4y23h7jw78h3jce3owlf.mp3","text":"在脑海中......有什么声音......在回响着......","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/p9mitnst0v9gr2802k851agbnvr84d6.mp3","text":"“汝等终将胜利”——此乃喀兰之允诺，亦是我所祈求。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/l0qfivbcn8s8u4h3875twafo08k8c8a.mp3","text":"什么时候你也需要祝福啦......能稍等一会吗，我准备一下。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/eohjz0kdpdphnzhrluwxauj8gwod3rw.mp3","text":"愿喀兰圣山与我们同在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/e1ew9ehrwz2salzmw4amnxjxx0s1vyh.mp3","text":"循着铃音，你定能找到正确的方向。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/ij5t44svrjys3szxoa3x8apnxd4ypwv.mp3","text":"让我为你向群山献上祈祷吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/ta6opof0odowco8pzxg6jbt33zx48rx.mp3","text":"不洁之物理应被净化。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/kddxkyaqavuby3aiof4yh5jaeslcosq.mp3","text":"小心一点。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/17/ojwjum8bo1gs5de1wx6f7iwqluwjgje.mp3","text":"整理好了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/a18o6dgb3oe14u3i7ft0si9gp4zayrr.mp3","text":"战斗吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/tiql7n2smwraripvfkaalh00bkq2iku.mp3","text":"祝福你。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/7jbsrptlrik58fnq6xae8yjt5ny8ttl.mp3","text":"神灵啊，愿您倾听我的声音。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/krc94n21wq29ft1ozlbot7fovcicnpq.mp3","text":"铃声已至，风雪缠足。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/mp31nkjq98ftg6mp5a3evl70cj3c1wd.mp3","text":"这力量乃是圣山的馈赠。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/76/q6gzamxpi0lej56s9dwkdpo9wikbdd1.mp3","text":"圣铃既响，坚甲不再。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/7fr2qd679rp661zaj4jv9jw9b35pihv.mp3","text":"如有神助，正是此般。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/te9qnzmj3p73919qslv88oyemusvo1m.mp3","text":"喀兰的光芒照耀在我们身上。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/0tjh44qrsrsakgol9fkd05y9wmf3s8r.mp3","text":"若是不流血就能取得胜利......不，忘了我说的吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/9cy2eqdpj9nuh5l2e1er1vo8gexc6wz.mp3","text":"回去吧......现在的局势对我方不利。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/dnodl9hw8l2pc3yt22swnopqimkos2f.mp3","text":"是一个让人心情平静的地方呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/0ub9qvvty89yypcbli6nj7okcn3bxe5.mp3","text":"呣？","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/mrg7ezbk195nyomsguaf5xznrd9j0pf.mp3","text":"闭上眼，让我带你去个新的地方......一定要闭眼哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:3/33/kijy48sf8fs6lumgmrc6urpbyuk6ews.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/qlw4i2urouizcbvt0pwgz33vhh4yvzn.mp3","text":"我怎么在这里？你看，恩希亚就在罗德岛，身为姐姐在新年时探望自己的妹妹，这是天经地义的一件事情，博士，你难道忍心让恩希亚一个人在外面过节吗？这样就太狠心了哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/lvlo8zczn9wt5lj6cajb0qbtwioxzzc.mp3","text":"祝福你，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_174_slbell/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/tb7uhyxm0ollram9gv1835rmbzashr0.mp3","text":"呣？想要祈祷吗？抱歉，暂时没空哦。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/iclbsekyf9oiro8ne8i8jm83c5xba2x.mp3","text":"呣？我是现任圣女没错哦。但无论是谁——都有被繁重事务压得喘不过气，想要轻松一下的时候吧。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/7l6eak0z8ae4kta5s8f04nuosso5tia.mp3","text":"在闲杂事务上浪费时间才叫懈怠，我只是......比较擅长寻找机会养精蓄锐而已。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/25/oolsooh0785ndx0nblz0um659f1qxqi.mp3","text":"出来玩耍就要尽兴，别把那些条条框框套在我身上呀。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/eo1zml8yhywaae7x8as2bav3t57iyin.mp3","text":"喀兰的神祇吗？因为圣女职务的关系，我和她关系不浅呢。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/mu4v93rjc4zx401sgufen9i6bmqwk78.mp3","text":"我也很愿意帮助你，但圣女的工作实在是太繁忙了。这次就破例一回，可不要占用我太多时间哦。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/02zgzp0etg3wq82fxnf7stz52n0mfwd.mp3","text":"妹——恩希亚那孩子，罗德岛的各位也都挺喜欢她的，是吧？所以，并不是那个人特殊对待她。现在的话，我也算稍微明白了些。嗯，这样就好了，我只要像现在这样看着她就好了。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/bha79orh9sb6gbx2r2ehdjr5ou5wq78.mp3","text":"小时候，我在外玩耍扭伤了脚，是哥哥背了我一晚上才找到了住家。那时我想着，一定要成为哥哥那样的人。但是现在......呵，没什么。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/89/fxjb86uio93aqexzsq2os73m06u2z89.mp3","text":"咦，你怎么找到我的？啧，我要把你的脚趾冻上......唔？咖啡？给我的？谢谢。博士要不要也在这偷会儿懒？这里的风景很好。把这里当作我们两个人的秘密吧。唔，好苦。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/02zuamcx05s7macrpgqx2zkt3n55nav.mp3","text":"难得的小憩呢。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/2upkivl24vo5oymq28hc8giov2jb9ct.mp3","text":"嘘，我是偷偷跑出来——啊，嗯，人事主管你也在啊，是的，我是来协助罗德岛的。喀兰圣女，初雪，向你献上至洁的祝福。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/2rfovocrlc72wq75tnewrf0c2b0ttbd.mp3","text":"在脑海中......有什么声音......在回响着......","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:9/93/4gf1joa73ig9uz6puml4pxp4j0hrnir.mp3","text":"“汝等终将胜利”——此乃喀兰之允诺，亦是我所祈求。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/cvrcjulvrc38zjijjy476gnk5rmp1sg.mp3","text":"什么时候你也需要祝福啦......能稍等一会吗，我准备一下。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/be/huc3gg463prh5z0mcyoulw3lr3uuevm.mp3","text":"愿喀兰圣山与我们同在。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/8wt3hz384v9poz48jp5yzl56rajiurs.mp3","text":"循着铃音，你定能找到正确的方向。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:0/09/abf7pvcv38m9igd14eunr20c2rrucv6.mp3","text":"让我为你向群山献上祈祷吧。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/31kekadpqql0zrrk7xwqe9sar0adj1b.mp3","text":"不洁之物理应被净化。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/p4z54kfpgswireswl2hbdnppilzi25y.mp3","text":"小心一点。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/44/in6t3g7hmz0ao6v59bwddzsew9bjqdj.mp3","text":"整理好了。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/0mli0szyogsx9etqycln5kfjzz4or8e.mp3","text":"战斗吧。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/51/9u54ksxh2rhgp6idca9eua70tit4p69.mp3","text":"祝福你。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/ry3r2a9boqx5fqvb0dollz5ppyxu0ka.mp3","text":"神灵啊，愿您倾听我的声音。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/80jgh3j4rejacduy435f09yfkp3nqgg.mp3","text":"铃声已至，风雪缠足。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/g1fp6j7pj4y2ul9qxzdrxmh1tm4bsuv.mp3","text":"这力量乃是圣山的馈赠。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/90/s3r29rnaw33eekrqxiluc5ir62dxlc7.mp3","text":"圣铃既响，坚甲不再。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/8mgtuh00mnrxevl4e5vxz3s9tmmls2l.mp3","text":"如有神助，正是此般。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/qkhm3rr808yfdsnqu8e7mqowyegb2h0.mp3","text":"喀兰的光芒照耀在我们身上。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/de/fivm1eg1y77wc9jwbavpaq0gyx9bx8f.mp3","text":"若是不流血就能取得胜利......不，忘了我说的吧。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/sgbaadfmetio9awtyutpklyiakx7pwq.mp3","text":"回去吧......现在的局势对我方不利。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/12tpovifde1158x82wyw3rx9om34psv.mp3","text":"是一个让人心情平静的地方呢。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:0/09/pged7smi2t2dx8xymqowdqw47hzpa1e.mp3","text":"呣？","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:8/89/4dz1sp9cfdr7rpuhx43auzkauk341o5.mp3","text":"闭上眼，让我带你去个新的地方......一定要闭眼哦。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/thadn28k7b3bz7tpndnugr1omdv9m01.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/o5u68yj9gfbmrwneh1wmtcejev8zy8b.mp3","text":"我怎么在这里？你看，恩希亚就在罗德岛，身为姐姐在新年时探望自己的妹妹，这是天经地义的一件事情，博士，你难道忍心让恩希亚一个人在外面过节吗？这样就太狠心了哦。","alt":"voice/char_174_slbell/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/anom1x9g0749u5aauqn2xi6tgcrz4